        {
          "id": "upload-and-resume",
          "title": "Resume an interrupted upload",
          "description": "Ana edits the photo and loses signal on the train halfway through uploading it. Her phone can send just the missing pieces when the signal returns. That saves data, but the service has to keep a record of which pieces arrived. Ana can see “Saved” once the pieces are stored and the file record points to them.",
